  "keyFeatures": [
    "AI-generated adaptive 4-week learning plans based on Moodle data and individual performance",
    "Soft skills assessment (autonomy, time management, communication, teamwork, problem solving)",
    "AI Tutor chat powered by Groq LLM (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct / llama-3.3-70b-versatile)",
    "Focus cards with prioritized study topics (2 High, 2 Medium, 2 Low priority)",
    "Team Leader analytics dashboard with at-risk coder detection and risk flagging",
    "AI-generated executive reports for clan and cohort-level performance",
    "Resource library with semantic search via embeddings (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)",
    "Social authentication (Google OAuth2, GitHub OAuth)",
    "OTP email verification for account security",
    "Evidence submission system for completed activities"
  ],
